      "key": [
        "Oceanid",
        "Fountain of Lucine",
        "Marcel's death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Marcel",
        "Vacher"
      ],
      "comment": "Marcel: The Oceanid at the Fountain",
      "content": "After the verdict, Marcel asked to be taken to the Fountain of Lucine because he had drunk so much Primordial Seawater he could see the Oceanid he took for Vigneire. It was instead his victims' collective consciousness, merged with her. It condemned him, said Vigneire hated what he had done, and drowned him. His death was ruled a panic attack.",
